# UI

Shadcn is the component library. Import from `@/components/ui`.

```tsx
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";

<Button type="submit">Save</Button>
```

- Add a missing piece with `npx shadcn@latest add <name>`.
- Do not install a second component library.
- Do not restyle with one-off button or input elements when a Shadcn component exists.
